# Top-level CODEOWNERS for the [Company Name] internal marketplace.
# Per-plugin ownership is defined in plugins/<name>/CODEOWNERS.
#
# Replace the bracketed placeholders with real GitHub usernames before this
# repo enforces protection.

# Default: every PR needs the engineering lead.
*                                   @[engineering-lead]

# Marketplace manifest controls which plugins workforce members can install.
# Must be reviewed by both engineering and the privacy officer.
/.claude-plugin/marketplace.json    @[engineering-lead] @[privacy-officer]

# HIPAA policies — any change requires the privacy officer and a security
# officer review.
/policies/                          @[privacy-officer] @[security-officer]

# Contributing guide and CODEOWNERS itself: engineering lead + privacy
# officer (because changes here can weaken review controls).
/CONTRIBUTING.md                    @[engineering-lead] @[privacy-officer]
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @[engineering-lead] @[privacy-officer]
/.github/workflows/                 @[engineering-lead]
